Bharata sends mothers with Vasiṣṭha and hurries ahead --- Bharata follows bark markers toward sacrificial smoke --- Bharata resolves to fall at Rāma's and Sītā's feet --- Bharata beholds the weapon-hung leaf hut --- Bharata sees ascetic Rāma with Sītā and Lakṣmaṇa --- Bharata bewails Rāma's lost royal splendor --- Bharata falls speechless at Rāma's feet --- Śatrughna bows and Rāma embraces both weeping --- Sumantra Guha and forest dwellers join in tears